msgid "评论者"
msgstr "Commentator"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:266
msgid "评论内容"
msgstr "Comment content"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:267
msgid "AI 评分"
msgstr "AI Score"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:268
msgid "执行操作"
msgstr "Perform the operation"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:269
msgid "时间"
msgstr "Time"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:276
msgid "暂无日志记录"
msgstr "No logs available"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:296
msgid "垃圾"
msgstr "trash"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:297
msgid "通过"
msgstr "Through"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:298
msgid "待审核"
msgstr "Pending review"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:328
msgid "&lsaquo;"
msgstr "&lsaquo;"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:329
msgid "&rsaquo;"
msgstr "&rsaquo;"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:368
msgid ""
"当前 WordPress 版本没有内置 AI Client，本插件需要 WordPress 7.0 或更高版本才"
"能工作。"
msgstr ""
"The current WordPress version does not include the built-in AI Client. This "
"plugin requires WordPress 7.0 or higher to work."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:372
msgid ""
"尚未配置 AI 供应商凭据，评论检测功能暂不生效。请前往后台“设置 → 连接”页面配置"
"至少一个 AI 供应商。"
msgstr ""
"No AI provider credentials have been configured yet, so comment detection is "
"not active. Please go to the \"Settings → Connectors\" screen in the admin "
"dashboard and configure at least one AI provider."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:376
msgid ""
"本插件通过 WordPress 内置 AI Client 调用 AI，无需单独配置 API 端点或密钥。AI "
"供应商凭据可在后台“设置 → 连接”页面统一管理。"
msgstr ""
"This plugin calls AI through the built-in WordPress AI Client, with no need "
"to configure API endpoints or keys separately. AI provider credentials can "
"be managed centrally on the \"Settings → Connectors\" screen in the admin "
"dashboard."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:384
msgid "AI 提供商"
msgstr "AI Provider"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:389
msgid "自动选择（由 WordPress 决定）"
msgstr "Automatic (decided by WordPress)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:398
msgid "选择用于评论评分的 AI 提供商，仅列出已配置凭据的提供商"
msgstr ""
"The AI provider used for comment scoring. Only providers with configured "
"credentials are listed"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:406
msgid "系统提示词"
msgstr "System Prompt"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:412
msgid "发送给 AI 的系统提示词，用于指导 AI 如何评分"
msgstr "System prompts sent to AI to guide how it assigns scores"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:420
msgid "分数阈值"
msgstr "Score threshold"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:427
msgid "低于此分数的评论将被标记为垃圾评论（0-100）"
msgstr "Comments scoring below this threshold will be flagged as spam (0-100)."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:435
msgid "检测到垃圾评论后的操作"
msgstr "Actions taken after detecting spam comments"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:440
msgid "移到垃圾队列"
msgstr "Move to trash queue"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:443 admin/class-admin-settings.php:475
msgid "移到待审核队列"
msgstr "Move to pending review queue"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:447
msgid "当评论分数低于阈值时的处理方式"
msgstr "Handling when the review score falls below the threshold"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:455
msgid "超时时间（秒）"
msgstr "Timeout (seconds)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:462
msgid "AI 请求超时时间"
msgstr "AI request timeout"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:470
msgid "检测失败后的操作"
msgstr "Action after detection failure"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:478
msgid "直接通过"
msgstr "Directly through"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:482
msgid "当 AI 检测失败（超时、未配置供应商、返回无效数据等）时的处理方式"
msgstr ""
"How to handle failed AI detections (timeouts, unconfigured providers, "
"invalid responses, etc.)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:490
msgid "日志保留时间"
msgstr "Log retention period"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:495
msgid "不保存"
msgstr "Do not save"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:498
msgid "1天"
msgstr "1 day"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:501
msgid "3天"
msgstr "3 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:504
msgid "7天"
msgstr "7 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:507
msgid "14天"
msgstr "14 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:510
msgid "30天"
msgstr "30 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:513
msgid "90天"
msgstr "90 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:516
msgid "180天"
msgstr "180 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:519
msgid "365天"
msgstr "365 days"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:522
msgid "永久保存"
msgstr "Permanent preservation"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:526
msgid "日志保留时长，过期日志将自动删除"
msgstr "Log retention period; expired logs will be automatically deleted"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:534
msgid "检测为垃圾评论后对访客的提醒"
msgstr "Reminder to visitors after detecting spam comments"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:540
msgid "当评论被AI检测为垃圾评论时显示给访客的提醒文字，留空则不提醒"
msgstr ""
"When a comment is detected by AI as spam, this is the warning message "
"displayed to visitors. Leave blank to disable the warning"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:548
msgid "检测失败后对访客的提醒"
msgstr "Reminder to visitors after detection failure"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:554
msgid "当AI检测失败（API错误、超时等）时显示给访客的提醒文字，留空则不提醒"
msgstr ""
"When AI detection fails (API errors, timeouts, etc.), display this alert "
"text to visitors. Leave blank to suppress the alert"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:598
msgid "权限不足"
msgstr "Insufficient permissions"

